Data room document storage uses Google Cloud Storage via `src/infrastructure/storage/google-cloud-storage.adapter.ts`, which generates signed URLs for uploads through `ListingAssetService.requestUploadUrl` in the data room module. The adapter handles GCS bucket operations and makes files public via `makePublic` after upload, while the storage factory (`src/infrastructure/storage/storage.factory.ts`) orchestrates this integration for product surfaces like listing assets.

